as not a successor of Kudahenaya the father? 27.When one peruses the evidence given by the only officer called by the Plaintiff from the Divisional Secretariat, Nuwara Eliya, that officer testified as to the procedure how nomination could be made in the case of a grant holder. However, no question has ever been asked of this witness in cross-examin

